  "description": "A notorious libertine and avid collector of beautiful men, the Marquess has always surrounded himself with exquisite companions. His loyal bodyguard's feelings for him, who has secretly harbored for years, is finally exposed. Surprised by the confession, the Marquess becomes curious about how far he can go with someone completely unlike his usual type. What begins as a harmless game soon sparks an unexpected change between them.\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/hujjok)",
